# Business Case - Cloud Migration

## Scenario

A company wants to launch an online store that needs to handle unpredictable traffic.

## Traditional Approach

Using physical servers would require buying enough hardware to support peak demand.

Problems:

- High initial cost.
- Difficult scalability.
- Hardware maintenance.

## AWS Solution

Using AWS allows the company to:

- Scale resources when needed.
- Pay only for consumed resources.
- Improve availability.
- Deploy applications faster.

## Conclusion

Cloud Computing allows companies to build flexible and scalable solutions without managing physical infrastructure.
